{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29128","headline":"和浙西从事刘三复送僧南归 · 许浑","name":"和浙西从事刘三复送僧南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客送僧归故乡，海门帆势极潇湘。\n碧云千里暮愁合，白雪一声春思长。\n满院草花平讲席，绕龛藤叶盖禅牀。\n怜师不得随师去，已戴儒冠事素王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}